ast is simple."], [166.28, "Lena", "I eat bread and drink apple juice."], [169.02, "Lena", "I drink apple juice for breakfast."], [171.77, "Lena", "A good breakfast makes me strong."], [174.43, "Lena", "I love breakfast!"], [175.8, "Lena", "Breakfast is the best meal."], [177.98, "Maya", "Ha!"], [178.22, "Maya", "Good."], [178.62, "Maya", "No cake and cookies for breakfast!"], [181.36, "Lena", "Well..."], [181.9, "Lena", "one small cookie for breakfast?"], [184.28, "Lena", "Just one!"], [184.98, "Maya", "Okay."], [185.31, "Maya", "One cookie and orange juice."], [187.2, "Maya", "Yum!"], [187.47, "Maya", "Let's eat pizza for breakfast tomorrow."], [190.1, "Lena", "Pizza for breakfast!"], [191.83, "Lena", "Great idea."], [192.78, "Lena", "Cold pizza and orange juice."], [195.19, "Lena", "Yum!"], [195.54, "Maya", "Let's say our five words one more time."], [198.47, "Maya", "Cake."], [198.84, "Maya", "Cookie."], [199.37, "Maya", "Pizza."], [199.82, "Maya", "Juice."], [200.27, "Maya", "Breakfast."], [201.02, "Lena", "Cake!"], [201.41, "Lena", "Cookie!"], [201.97, "Lena", "Pizza!"], [202.44, "Lena", "Juice!"], [202.91, "Lena", "Breakfast!"], [203.7, "Lena", "I love food days on Word Kitchen."], [206.3, "Maya", "Me too."], [206.9, "Maya", "Join us tomorrow on Word Kitchen."], [209.73, "Maya", "Bye!"], [210.07, "Lena", "Bye, everyone!"]]}